:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Ovis (Enemy)]].''
'''Ovis''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and can be acquired as a [[Timed Stage Reward]] when completing [[Sheep's Bravado]] with a score of 4,500 or more during the [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 420
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Ovis
|name2 = Ovis CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ovis CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
With around half the HP, price, and cooldown of a [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] of the same level, Ovis can perform as a capable anti-Red meatshield in [[Empire of Cats]] stages and very early [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]]. However, his relatively high range interferes with his ability to protect certain melee units, such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] and [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], from Red enemies, as he outranges them, causing them to go in front of Otis, rendering him useless until they get knocked back.

With further progression, Ovis begins to falter, as he is outclassed by [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)#Maximum the Fighter|Maximum the Fighter]], who provides similar HP against Reds and far greater DPS for a slightly lower price. Additionally, Maximum has less range, allowing him to actually protect melee units. Unfortunately, no amount of boost will save it from this fate either, as it has too low base stats. By the time you reach [[Cats of the Cosmos]], this sheep will have long outlived its usefulness, other than for boosting [[User Rank]] and as [[Underground Labyrinth|Labyrinth]] fodder.

